<div data-cgap-sector="Mining, Quarries &amp; Asphalt" data-cgap-term="quarry"></div><p class="lead">Quarries and mines move more material per hour than almost any other industry, and the equipment does not stop for anyone: crushers, conveyors, screens, haul trucks that cannot see a pickup, and stockpiles that can bury a person who walks too close.</p><p>These signs are written for those spots, from the blasting area and the highwall to the primary crusher, conveyors and screens, stockpiles and reclaim tunnels, haul roads, asphalt plants and underground work. They are 8x12 rust-resistant aluminum made for dust, rain and vibration.</p><h2>What to post, and where</h2><div class="il-areas"><div class="il-area il-best"><h3>Most ordered</h3><p>The signs customers in this industry order most.</p><ul><li><span data-s="DANGER">DANGER</span><a href="/products/danger-underground-jackhammering-sign-vibrations-and-noise-hazard-hearing-protection-required-8x12-rust-resistant-aluminum-tunnel-and-construction-safety-sign-by-cgap-safety">Underground Jackhammering</a></li><li><span data-s="DANGER">DANGER</span><a href="/products/blasting-danger-sign-explosives-and-flying-debris-for-underground-shafts-8x12-uv-resistant-rust-resistant-aluminum-professional-facility-grade-by-cgap-safety">Blasting</a></li><li><span data-s="DANGER">DANGER</span><a href="/products/batching-weigh-hopper-danger-sign-falling-material-hazard-for-material-handling-8x12-uv-resistant-rust-resistant-aluminum-professional-facility-grade-by-cgap-safety">Batching Weigh Hopper</a></li></ul></div><div class="il-area"><h3>Blasting and explosives</h3><p>Blast areas, magazines, guards and all clear signals. 308 signs. Typical spot: Mount on the barricade or access gate at the edge of the blast area.</p><ul><li><span data-s="DANGER">DANGER</span><a href="/products/blasting-danger-sign-explosives-and-flying-debris-for-underground-shafts-8x12-uv-resistant-rust-resistant-aluminum-professional-facility-grade-by-cgap-safety">Blasting</a></li><li><span data-s="WARNING">WARNING</span><a href="/products/warning-post-blast-area-sign-cgap-w03479-812">Post Blast Area</a></li><li><span data-s="CAUTION">CAUTION</span><a href="/products/caution-detonator-hand-cart-sign-cgap-c02004-812">Detonator Hand Cart</a></li><li><span data-s="NOTICE">NOTICE</span><a href="/products/notice-misfire-log-book-sign-cgap-n10623-812">Misfire Log Book</a></li></ul></div><div class="il-area"><h3>Crushers</h3><p>Primary, secondary and portable crushers. 213 signs. Typical spot: Feed opening and access covers.</p><ul><li><span data-s="DANGER">DANGER</span><a href="/products/danger-roll-crusher-sign-8x12-aluminum">Roll Crusher</a></li><li><span data-s="WARNING">WARNING</span><a href="/products/warning-jaw-crusher-flywheel-sign-cgap-w01305-812">Jaw Crusher Flywheel</a></li><li><span data-s="CAUTION">CAUTION</span><a href="/products/caution-crusher-tool-crib-sign-cgap-c09537-812">Crusher Tool Crib</a></li><li><span data-s="NOTICE">NOTICE</span><a href="/products/notice-primary-dump-hopper-sign-cgap-n01054-812">Primary Dump Hopper</a></li></ul></div><div class="il-area"><h3>Conveyors and screens</h3><p>Belts, pulleys, screens and radial stackers. 391 signs. Typical spot: Tail end guard of quarry conveyors.</p><ul><li><span data-s="DANGER">DANGER</span><a href="/products/danger-wing-tail-pulley-sign-8x12-aluminum">Wing Tail Pulley</a></li><li><span data-s="WARNING">WARNING</span><a href="/products/warning-belt-winder-sign-cgap-w17905-812">Belt Winder</a></li><li><span data-s="CAUTION">CAUTION</span><a href="/products/caution-conveyor-gearbox-sign-cgap-c13037-812">Conveyor Gearbox</a></li><li><span data-s="NOTICE">NOTICE</span><a href="/products/notice-conveyor-walkway-sign-cgap-n14317-812">Conveyor Walkway</a></li></ul></div><div class="il-area"><h3>Stockpiles and reclaim tunnels</h3><p>Stockpiles, reclaim tunnels, feeders and hoppers. 278 signs. Typical spot: At the feeder access walkway near the tail sprocket guard.</p><ul><li><span data-s="DANGER">DANGER</span><a href="/products/batching-weigh-hopper-danger-sign-falling-material-hazard-for-material-handling-8x12-uv-resistant-rust-resistant-aluminum-professional-facility-grade-by-cgap-safety">Batching Weigh Hopper</a></li><li><span data-s="WARNING">WARNING</span><a href="/products/warning-crusher-feeder-service-sign-cgap-w00505-812">Crusher Feeder Service</a></li><li><span data-s="CAUTION">CAUTION</span><a href="/products/caution-hopper-loader-ramp-sign-cgap-c01054-812">Hopper Loader Ramp</a></li><li><span data-s="NOTICE">NOTICE</span><a href="/products/notice-rap-feed-bin-sign-cgap-n07114-812">RAP Feed Bin</a></li></ul></div><div class="il-area"><h3>Haul roads and mobile equipment</h3><p>Haul roads, berms and blind spots around big equipment. 53 signs. Typical spot: Top and bottom of the loader ramp.</p><ul><li><span data-s="DANGER">DANGER</span><a href="/products/danger-loader-feed-ramp-sign-8x12-aluminum">Loader Feed Ramp</a></li><li><span data-s="WARNING">WARNING</span><a href="/products/warning-haul-truck-body-prop-sign-cgap-w00512-812">Haul Truck Body Prop</a></li><li><span data-s="CAUTION">CAUTION</span><a href="/products/caution-rap-bin-loader-ramp-sign-cgap-c07114-812">RAP Bin Loader Ramp</a></li><li><span data-s="NOTICE">NOTICE</span><a href="/products/notice-washout-area-berm-sign-cgap-n22264-812">Washout Area Berm</a></li></ul></div><div class="il-area"><h3>The pit: drilling, faces and scales</h3><p>Drilling, stockpile faces, truck scales and the wheel wash. 35 signs. Typical spot: On the jumbo frame at the operator and helper sides.</p><ul><li><span data-s="DANGER">DANGER</span><a href="/products/danger-drill-jumbo-sign-8x12-aluminum">Drill Jumbo</a></li><li><span data-s="WARNING">WARNING</span><a href="/products/warning-quarry-truck-scale-sign-cgap-w17869-812">Quarry Truck Scale</a></li><li><span data-s="NOTICE">NOTICE</span><a href="/products/notice-quarry-wheel-wash-sign-cgap-n24148-812">Quarry Wheel Wash</a></li><li><span data-s="DANGER">DANGER</span><a href="/products/danger-stockpile-face-sign-8x12-aluminum">Stockpile Face</a></li></ul></div><div class="il-area"><h3>Asphalt plants</h3><p>Drum dryers, burners, silos and liquid asphalt tanks. 366 signs. Typical spot: Pugmill access covers.</p><ul><li><span data-s="DANGER">DANGER</span><a href="/products/danger-asphalt-pugmill-sign-8x12-aluminum">Asphalt Pugmill</a></li><li><span data-s="WARNING">WARNING</span><a href="/products/warning-asphalt-tack-wand-sign-cgap-w01308-812">Asphalt Tack Wand</a></li><li><span data-s="CAUTION">CAUTION</span><a href="/products/caution-silo-top-hatch-sign-cgap-c18701-812">Silo Top Hatch</a></li><li><span data-s="NOTICE">NOTICE</span><a href="/products/notice-baghouse-compressor-sign-cgap-n14183-812">Baghouse Compressor</a></li></ul></div><div class="il-area"><h3>Underground work</h3><p>Shafts, tunnels, portals and drilling underground. 56 signs. Typical spot: Mount on the wall at the top of the steps to the reclaim tunnel at the reclaim tunnel steps.</p><ul><li><span data-s="DANGER">DANGER</span><a href="/products/danger-underground-jackhammering-sign-vibrations-and-noise-hazard-hearing-protection-required-8x12-rust-resistant-aluminum-tunnel-and-construction-safety-sign-by-cgap-safety">Underground Jackhammering</a></li><li><span data-s="WARNING">WARNING</span><a href="/products/warning-mine-hoist-sign-cgap-w17829-812">Mine Hoist</a></li><li><span data-s="CAUTION">CAUTION</span><a href="/products/caution-reclaim-tunnel-steps-sign-cgap-c05634-812">Reclaim Tunnel Steps</a></li><li><span data-s="NOTICE">NOTICE</span><a href="/products/notice-reclaim-tunnel-sump-sign-cgap-n15732-812">Reclaim Tunnel Sump</a></li></ul></div></div><h2>Common questions</h2><div class="il-faq"><details><summary>What signs should go at a quarry entrance?</summary><p>Typical postings cover blasting warnings, hard hat and high visibility requirements, haul truck right of way and checking in at the office. Search &quot;blasting&quot; or &quot;haul road&quot; to see the options.</p></details><details><summary>Do you have signs for crushers and conveyors?</summary><p>Yes, including lockout before clearing a jam, pinch points, belt cleaning and staying off the conveyor. Search &quot;crusher&quot; or &quot;conveyor&quot;.</p></details><details><summary>Do you make signs for asphalt plants?</summary><p>Yes, including hot mix silos, drum dryers, burners, liquid asphalt tanks and truck load out. Search &quot;asphalt plant&quot;.</p></details></div><script type="application/ld+json">{"@context": "https://schema.org", "@type": "FAQPage", "mainEntity": [{"@type": "Question", "name": "What signs should go at a quarry entrance?", "acceptedAnswer": {"@type": "Answer", "text": "Typical postings cover blasting warnings, hard hat and high visibility requirements, haul truck right of way and checking in at the office. Search \"blasting\" or \"haul road\" to see the options."}}, {"@type": "Question", "name": "Do you have signs for crushers and conveyors?", "acceptedAnswer": {"@type": "Answer", "text": "Yes, including lockout before clearing a jam, pinch points, belt cleaning and staying off the conveyor. Search \"crusher\" or \"conveyor\"."}}, {"@type": "Question", "name": "Do you make signs for asphalt plants?", "acceptedAnswer": {"@type": "Answer", "text": "Yes, including hot mix silos, drum dryers, burners, liquid asphalt tanks and truck load out. Search \"asphalt plant\"."}}]}</script>